# Day 20/60 — AI Face Puzzle Game

## Objective

Build an interactive puzzle game using AI-generated code and browser technologies.

## Project Overview

Created a web-based puzzle game that converts a user's photo into a playable puzzle.

Users can capture an image through their webcam and solve the puzzle by rearranging shuffled pieces.

## Features

- Webcam Photo Capture
- Dynamic Puzzle Generation
- Multiple Difficulty Levels
  - 3x3
  - 4x4
  - 5x5
- Drag-and-Drop Controls
- Move Counter
- Completion Timer
- Responsive Gameplay

## What I Learned

### AI Accelerates Prototyping

Applications that would normally take hours can be generated and refined significantly faster.

### Browser APIs Are Powerful

Modern web applications can access device hardware such as cameras directly from the browser.

### Games Are Systems

A puzzle game combines UI design, state management, user interaction, and logic into one cohesive system.

### AI Extends Beyond Productivity

AI can assist with building products for entertainment, education, and engagement.

## Key Insight

AI is becoming a creative development partner.

The same workflow used for business applications can also be applied to interactive consumer products.

